20260902 095356.386 INFO             PET1     ESMX_Driver: index= 272                                 MPIR_CVAR_REQUEST_ERR_FATAL : By default, MPI_Waitall, MPI_Testall, MPI_Waitsome, and MPI_Testsome return MPI_ERR_IN_STATUS when one of the request fails. If MPIR_CVAR_REQUEST_ERR_FATAL is set to true, these routines will return the error code of the request immediately. The default MPI_ERRS_ARE_FATAL error handler will dump a error stack in this case, which maybe more convenient for debugging. This cvar will also make nonblocking shched return error right away as it issues operations.
