20260902 095356.411 INFO             PET2     ESMX_Driver: index= 275                            MPIR_CVAR_DEBUG_PROGRESS_TIMEOUT : Sets the timeout in seconds to dump outstanding requests when progress wait is not making progress for some time.
20260902 095356.411 INFO             PET2     ESMX_Driver: index= 276                                      MPIR_CVAR_DIMS_VERBOSE : If true, enable verbose output about the actions of the implementation of MPI_Dims_create.
20260902 095356.411 INFO             PET2     ESMX_Driver: index= 277                                    MPIR_CVAR_QMPI_TOOL_LIST : Set the number and order of QMPI tools to be loaded by the MPI library when it is initialized.
20260902 095356.411 INFO             PET2     ESMX_Driver: index= 278                              MPIR_CVAR_NAMESERV_FILE_PUBDIR : Sets the directory to use for MPI service publishing in the file nameserv implementation.  Allows the user to override where the publish and lookup information is placed for connect/accept based applications.
20260902 095356.411 INFO             PET2     ESMX_Driver: index= 279                           MPIR_CVAR_ABORT_ON_LEAKED_HANDLES : If true, MPI will call MPI_Abort at MPI_Finalize if any MPI object handles have been leaked.  For example, if MPI_Comm_dup is called without calling a corresponding MPI_Comm_free.  For uninteresting reasons, enabling this option may prevent all known object leaks from being reported.  MPICH must have been configure with "--enable-g=handlealloc" or better in order for this functionality to work.
20260902 095356.411 INFO             PET2     ESMX_Driver: index= 280                                  MPIR_CVAR_NETLOC_NODE_FILE : Subnet json file
20260902 095356.411 INFO             PET2     ESMX_Driver: index= 281                                           MPIR_CVAR_NOLOCAL : If true, force all processes to operate as though all processes are located on another node.  For example, this disables shared memory communication hierarchical collectives.
20260902 095356.411 INFO             PET2     ESMX_Driver: index= 282                                  MPIR_CVAR_ODD_EVEN_CLIQUES : If true, odd procs on a node are seen as local to each other, and even procs on a node are seen as local to each other.  Used for debugging on a single machine. Deprecated in favor of MPIR_CVAR_NUM_CLIQUES.
