20260902 095356.411 INFO             PET2     ESMX_Driver: index= 284                                  MPIR_CVAR_CLIQUES_BY_BLOCK : Specify to divide processes into cliques by uniform blocks. The default is to divide in round-robin fashion. Used for debugging on a single machine.
