20260902 095356.414 INFO             PET2     ESMX_Driver: index= 348                          MPIR_CVAR_CH4_OFI_MAX_EAGAIN_RETRY : If set to positive, this CVAR specifies the maximum number of retries of an ofi operations before returning MPIX_ERR_EAGAIN. This value is effective only when the communicator has the MPI_OFI_set_eagain info hint set to true.
